 TRA                                         44- 47  REACTION SF2                                                          
 TRA                                                 * any code is allowed                                                 
 TRA                                         49      INL flag                                                              
 TRA                                                 . The outgoing particle code appears as INL                           
 TRA                                                   when the same particle code is in SF2.                              
 TRA                                                  Example:                                                             
 TRA                                                    MT4 SF2=A -> SF3=N                                                 
 TRA                                                    MT4 SF2=N -> SF3=INL                                               
